---
// A one-time nudge above the scroll-scrubbed diagram. The scrub is invisible
// until the reader scrolls, so a reader who lands on a half-drawn diagram
// could read it as a broken page and move on. Three stacked chevrons plus
// one line say what to do. timeline.ts fades it out on the first scroll
// progress inside the section and never brings it back.
//
// Under the OS reduced-motion preference the diagram ships fully drawn and
// no ScrollTrigger is registered, so the hint would be a false promise: the
// media query below removes it entirely in that case.
---

<p
  data-scroll-hint
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="scroll-hint flex flex-col items-center gap-2 pb-6 text-center text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-blueprint-dim transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out md:pb-8"
>
  <span class="scroll-hint-chevrons flex flex-col items-center" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="18" height="10" viewBox="0 0 18 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 1l8 8 8-8" /></svg>
    <svg width="18" height="10" viewBox="0 0 18 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 1l8 8 8-8" /></svg>
    <svg width="18" height="10" viewBox="0 0 18 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 1l8 8 8-8" /></svg>
  </span>
  <span class="px-6">Scroll to trace the flow,<br class="md:hidden" /> step by step</span>
</p>

<style>
  .scroll-hint[data-hidden] {
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* The three chevrons breathe one after the other, top to bottom, so the
     eye reads a downward direction without anything moving on the page. */
  .scroll-hint-chevrons svg {
    margin-top: -3px;
    opacity: 0.25;
    animation: scroll-hint-breathe 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .scroll-hint-chevrons svg:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
  }
  .scroll-hint-chevrons svg:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 0.4s;
  }

  @keyframes scroll-hint-breathe {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.25;
    }
    40% {
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scroll-hint {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
